Local patch 100-native612-compat.patch adapts the setsockopt callback to
sockptr_t/copy_from_sockptr, drops obsolete netlink cfg fields, propagates
const MAC pointers, and suppresses only legacy missing-declaration/prototype
warnings while preserving -Werror for the remaining diagnostics. It also
starts the optional temporary IP filter disabled: loading the module alone
must not block existing bridge traffic. Daemon commands can still enable it.

No boot autoload entry is installed; ax6000-mesh loads the module when enabled.
